message: "If you use Sudarshana Chakra in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Sudarshana Chakra: Autonomous Desktop Operating Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Sudarshana Chakra is a self-evolving, multimodal personal AI desktop
  environment for Windows. It combines real-time native voice, computer vision,
  autonomous multi-step desktop automation, on-the-fly tool synthesis, and
  self-healing code to act as a Jarvis-style command center. It ships with
  100+ built-in tools including enterprise business verticals (inventory,
  procurement, finance, manufacturing, marketing) and autonomous deep research.
